# Pops: the A/C on (615h byte 0 = C0h), a lift at 110 km/h in 4th (16.5 s), then the clutch in at 30 km/h.
drive pops-lift-ac
start blank
set coolant=90 oil=90 intake=33 ambient=20 ac=1
3 on
1.5 crank rpm=200
6 idle
6 drive gear=4 speed=25..110 pedal=30
10 drive gear=4 speed=110..30 pedal=0
2 drive gear=4 speed=30 pedal=0 clutch=1
3 idle
